sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant FE as Frontend /design
    participant API_D as /api/v1/design/analyze
    participant DS as DesignService
    participant NDG as neural_design_graph
    participant AI as AIClientManager
    participant RAG as RagRetriever/KnowledgeRetriever
    participant API_TC as /api/v1/test-cases
    participant API_EX as /api/v1/executions
    participant C as Celery
    participant W as Worker

    U->>FE: Submit PRD / requirement text
    FE->>API_D: POST /design/analyze
    API_D->>DS: analyze_requirement(request)
    DS->>NDG: ainvoke(initial_state)
    NDG->>RAG: retrieve API/domain context
    NDG->>AI: multi-agent reasoning (scenario extraction)
    AI-->>NDG: scenario list
    NDG-->>DS: final_state.scenarios
    DS-->>API_D: scenarios[]
    API_D-->>FE: analyzed scenarios

    U->>FE: Confirm one scenario
    FE->>API_D: POST /design/generate
    API_D->>DS: generate_test_case(scenario, project_id)
    DS->>RAG: retrieve relevant APIs/knowledge
    DS->>AI: draft generation + critic refinement
    AI-->>DS: RefinedTestCase
    DS-->>API_D: test case payload
    API_D-->>FE: generated case

    FE->>API_TC: POST /test-cases
    API_TC-->>FE: TC_ID
    FE->>API_EX: POST /executions (tc_ids)
    API_EX->>C: enqueue execute_test_cases
    C-->>W: task delivered
    W-->>FE: poll via /executions/{id}
